Basic `<$notebook-kit/>` javascript examples. Click on the numbered tabs to edit a cells source code.

<<js-example "cells containing only an expression have automatic output display" '42 "[1,2,3,4]" {a:1,b:2,c:3} [["hello"]]'>>
<<js-example "javscript statements require explict call to 'display'" "
  display(44);
  [[display(45); display(46);]]
">>
<<js-example "cross-cell variables" "
  [[const x = 42; display(x);]]
  [[x * 9]]
">>
<<js-example "javascript errors" "
  [[123 abc; /* invalid syntax */]]
  [[abc; /* runtime error */]]
">>
